IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE-CHAIN-02.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 AMOUNT PIC 9(3)V9(2).
05 FACTOR PIC 9(1)V9(2).
05 DIVISOR PIC 9(1).
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TOTAL PIC S9(3)V9(2) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
05 OUT-MARK PIC X(1) VALUE "R".
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 IN-OPENED PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
01 OUT-OPENED PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
01 ADJUSTMENT PIC S9(2)V9(2) USAGE IS COMP-3 VALUE +0.50.
01 TOTAL PIC S9(3)V9(2) USAGE IS COMP-3 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
OPEN INPUT INFILE
IF IN-STATUS = "00"
    MOVE "Y" TO IN-OPENED
END-IF
OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE
IF OUT-STATUS = "00"
    MOVE "Y" TO OUT-OPENED
END-IF
IF IN-OPENED = "Y"
    READ INFILE AT END
        MOVE "E" TO OUT-MARK
    END-READ
    IF IN-STATUS = "00"
        PERFORM CALCULATE
        IF OUT-OPENED = "Y"
            WRITE OUT-REC
        END-IF
    END-IF
END-IF
DISPLAY IN-STATUS "/" OUT-STATUS
IF IN-OPENED = "Y"
    CLOSE INFILE
    DISPLAY IN-STATUS
END-IF
IF OUT-OPENED = "Y"
    CLOSE OUTFILE
    DISPLAY OUT-STATUS
END-IF
STOP RUN.
CALCULATE.
COMPUTE TOTAL = (AMOUNT * FACTOR + ADJUSTMENT) / DIVISOR ROUNDED END-COMPUTE
MOVE TOTAL TO OUT-TOTAL
.
